 "caption": "Is your AI assistant sending patients' NHS numbers to an AI company?\n\nPatients overshare in website forms. This n8n workflow adds one Code node before the AI step: it strips date of birth, NHS number, postcode, phone and email, so the AI only sees what it needs to triage the message. The full details stay inside n8n for the personal reply.\n\nReal n8n run on a demo clinic site. The AI answer is simulated and labelled; the redacted text shown is the real request n8n sent.\n\nSave this before your next healthcare build, and DM me FLOW for the free clinic workflow.\n\n#n8n #automation #aiautomation #clinicmarketing #nocode #dataprivacy"
